---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <Header />

  <main class="flex-1">
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-50 via-brand-50 to-brand-100/60"></div>
      <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-brand-200/30 blur-3xl"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-32 -left-32 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-brand-300/20 blur-3xl"></div>

      <div class="container-narrow relative section-padding">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
          <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-brand-200 bg-white/80 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-brand-700 shadow-sm backdrop-blur">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-500"></span>
            Phoenix · Premium Wax Services
          </div>
          <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-accent-900 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
            PHX <span class="text-brand-600">Wax Salon</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-accent-600 sm:text-xl">
            Professional Brazilian wax services in the Valley. Hard-wax technique for sensitive areas, 
            delivering smooth results that last <strong class="font-semibold text-accent-800">3 to 4 weeks</strong>.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-10 flex w-full flex-col items-stretch justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-4">
            <a href="#services" class="btn-primary w-full sm:w-auto">
              Explore Services
            </a>
            <a href="#acquisition" class="btn-secondary w-full sm:w-auto">
              Domain Available
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About -->
    <section id="about" class="section-padding bg-white">
      <div class="container-narrow">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-accent-900 sm:text-4xl">
            Brazilian Wax Excellence in Phoenix
          </h2>
          <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-accent-700 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Wax epilation extracts hair from the root using warm or hard wax, providing smooth skin for 3 to 4 weeks. 
              It is generally considered less painful than epilators because the discomfort is a short, sharp sensation 
              rather than continuous pinching.
            </p>
            <p>
              In the Phoenix climate, professional hard-wax techniques are especially effective for the bikini line 
              and underarms—formulations designed to adhere to the hair shaft rather than the skin, reducing irritation 
              and supporting consistent, reliable results.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Services / Characteristics -->
    <section id="services" class="section-padding bg-brand-50">
      <div class="container-narrow">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-accent-900 sm:text-4xl">
            Service Highlights
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-accent-600">
            The practical advantages of professional Brazilian waxing.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <article class="card group">
            <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 transition-colors group-hover:bg-brand-200">
              <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-accent-900">Effectiveness</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-accent-600">
              Removes both coarse and fine hairs effectively. Consistent sessions lead to finer regrowth over time.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card group">
            <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 transition-colors group-hover:bg-brand-200">
              <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 6a3.75 3.75 0 11-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 017.5 0zM4.501 20.118a7.5 7.5 0 0114.998 0A17.933 17.933 0 0112 21.75c-2.676 0-5.216-.584-7.499-1.632z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-accent-900">Sensitive Areas</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-accent-600">
              Hard wax is ideal for the bikini line and underarms—it adheres only to hair, not skin.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card group">
            <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 transition-colors group-hover:bg-brand-200">
              <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-accent-900">Preparation</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-accent-600">
              Hair should be ¼ to ½ inch long. Proper timing between sessions ensures optimal adhesion and comfort.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card group">
            <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 transition-colors group-hover:bg-brand-200">
              <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v12m-3-2.818l.879.659c1.171.879 3.07.879 4.242 0 1.172-.879 1.172-2.303 0-3.182C13.536 12.219 12.768 12 12 12c-.725 0-1.45-.22-2.003-.659-1.106-.879-1.106-2.303 0-3.182s2.9-.879 4.006 0l.415.33M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-accent-900">Value</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-accent-600">
              Recurring professional care delivers consistent results that at-home methods often struggle to match.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card group sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
            <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 transition-colors group-hover:bg-brand-200">
              <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.75 3.104v5.714a2.25 2.25 0 01-.659 1.591L5 14.5M9.75 3.104c-.251.023-.501.05-.75.082m.75-.082a24.301 24.301 0 014.5 0m0 0v5.714c0 .597.237 1.17.659 1.591L19.8 15.3M14.25 3.104c.251.023.501.05.75.082M19.8 15.3l-1.57.393A9.065 9.065 0 0112 15a9.065 9.065 0 00-6.23.693L5 14.5m14.8.8l1.402 1.402c1.232 1.232.65 3.318-1.067 3.611A48.309 48.309 0 0112 21c-2.773 0-5.491-.235-8.135-.687-1.718-.293-2.3-2.379-1.067-3.61L5 14.5" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-accent-900">Skin Benefits</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-accent-600">
              Gentle exfoliation removes dead skin cells. Temporary redness is common and typically resolves quickly.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Why Phoenix / Reliability -->
    <section id="why" class="section-padding bg-white">
      <div class="container-narrow">
        <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-accent-900 sm:text-4xl">
              Built for the Valley
            </h2>
            <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-accent-600">
              Professional wax services designed around Phoenix clients’ needs—heat, activity, and lasting smoothness.
            </p>
            <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4">
              <li class="flex gap-3">
                <span class="mt-1 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700">
                  <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" />
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span class="text-accent-700">
                  <strong class="font-medium text-accent-900">Root extraction</strong> — delays regrowth for weeks at a time.
                </span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-3">
                <span class="mt-1 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700">
                  <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" />
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span class="text-accent-700">
                  <strong class="font-medium text-accent-900">Finer regrowth</strong> — consistent care softens hair over months.
                </span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-3">
                <span class="mt-1 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700">
                  <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" />
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span class="text-accent-700">
                  <strong class="font-medium text-accent-900">Hard wax focus</strong> — minimal skin pull for delicate zones.
                </span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-3">
                <span class="mt-1 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700">
                  <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" />
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span class="text-accent-700">
                  <strong class="font-medium text-accent-900">Climate-aware</strong> — technique suited to Arizona heat and activity levels.
                </span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="relative">
            <div class="rounded-3xl border border-brand-100 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-50 to-white p-8 shadow-lg shadow-brand-100/50">
              <div class="space-y-6">
                <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between border-b border-brand-100 pb-4">
                  <span class="text-sm font-medium text-accent-500">Duration of smoothness</span>
                  <span class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-brand-700">3–4 weeks</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between border-b border-brand-100 pb-4">
                  <span class="text-sm font-medium text-accent-500">Ideal hair length</span>
                  <span class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-brand-700">¼–½ in</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between border-b border-brand-100 pb-4">
                  <span class="text-sm font-medium text-accent-500">Preferred method</span>
                  <span class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-brand-700">Hard wax</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between">
                  <span class="text-sm font-medium text-accent-500">Primary focus</span>
                  <span class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-brand-700">Bikini · Underarm</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Closing -->
    <section class="border-t border-brand-100 bg-brand-50/50 py-12">
      <div class="container-narrow text-center">
        <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-sm text-accent-500">
          Information presented reflects widely accepted professional understanding of wax epilation technology 
          and is intended solely for educational and demonstration purposes.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
